 ## Languages

 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
-`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server selects the supported language with the highest positive
+quality value in `Accept-Language`. Region tags such as `ko-KR` match their base
+language. Ties follow header order. If no supported language matches,
+the server uses `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
